                    <msContents><!-- describe the intellectual content of an inscription -->
                        <summary>This inscription records the endowment for a <foreign>dīpa-vr̥kṣa</foreign> to the deities, Tailēśvara and Āditya of the Dammikuṇṭe village by Nāgiyagāvuṇda in memory of his wife, Vēmakabbe. Incidentally, it mentions Āhavamalladēva’s victory over Uppaḷa during his northern expedition. 
                            
                        </summary>
                        <!-- offers the possibility to give a summary of the inscription's content -->
                    </msContents>
